          "path": "_m/g/c/s/e/cregneash-wp/cregneash-village-muse.jpg",
          "filename": "Cregneash Village - The Museum (Cummel Beg) - geograph.org.uk - 1692201.jpg",
          "caption": "Cregneash Village - The Museum (Cummel Beg) Visitors to Cregneash Village should first visit The Museum (Cummel Beg)(Little Dwelling) to view an audio-viaual presentation about the development of this village; to see a display about the history of the village and villagers; and to become familiar with the layout of the village and the identification of  sites that are part of the museum. A shop in the museum has publications, souvenirs, etc for sale. Next to the museum is the Cregneash Cafe that sales traditional Manx food. View is to the northeast. This two-story cottage was once a one-story thatched cottage.",
          "alt": "Cregneash Village - The Museum (Cummel Beg) Visitors to Cregneash Village should first visit The Museum (Cummel Beg)(Little Dwelling) to view an audio-viaual presentation about the development of this village; to see a display about the history of the village and villagers; and to become familiar with the layout of the village and the identification of  sites that are part of the museum. A shop in the museum has publications, souvenirs, etc for sale. Next to the museum is the Cregneash Cafe that sales traditional Manx food. View is to the northeast. This two-story cottage was once a one-story thatched cottage.",
